## Derivatives at endpoints

In Case III the paper evaluates $\partial_xG_{P,\beta}$ and $J'(1-x)$ on the closed interval
$x\in[\frac14,\frac12]$. The Lean function `G_P β` is not differentiable at $\frac14$ (where
